1:["$","main",null,{"className":"our-story-page content-frame","id":"top","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"breadcrumbs","aria-label":"Breadcrumb","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"/haxxed-grooming-concept/","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Our Story"}]]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"our-story-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"micro-label","children":"HAXXED Grooming Co."}],["$","h1",null,{"children":["Our Story",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"."}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"our-story-heading__stroke","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"our-story-opening","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"our-story-portrait","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0723/0128/1561/files/klsnvev_480x480.png?v=1730640830","alt":"HAXXED grooming style: a man with styled hair, sunglasses and a tailored suit","fetchPriority":"high"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"HAXXED / INDIA"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"EST. 2019"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"brand-story-verbatim","children":[["$","p","It never started as a business. It started with a passion.\nFor years, I struggled to find the right hair product in the Indian market. Everything I found was “one product for everyone”—no consideration for different hair types, no options for different hair styles, and definitely no real performance.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"It never started as a business. It started with a passion.\nFor years, I struggled to find the right hair product in the Indian market. Everything I found was “one product for everyone”—no consideration for different hair types, no options for different hair styles, and definitely no real performance."]}]]}],["$","p","Most products used harsh chemicals, felt cheap, and gave disappointing results. My hair deserved better—and so did every Indian man.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"Most products used harsh chemicals, felt cheap, and gave disappointing results. My hair deserved better—and so did every Indian man."]}]]}],["$","p","When I looked outside India, I saw a completely different world. International brands were using clean ingredients, focusing on performance, and offering a huge range based on hair needs. But getting those products shipped to India was expensive—almost nobody could afford using them regularly.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"When I looked outside India, I saw a completely different world. International brands were using clean ingredients, focusing on performance, and offering a huge range based on hair needs. But getting those products shipped to India was expensive—almost nobody could afford using them regularly."]}]]}],["$","p","That frustration turned into curiosity.\nCuriosity turned into experimentation.\nAnd experimentation turned into a mission.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"That frustration turned into curiosity.\nCuriosity turned into experimentation.\nAnd experimentation turned into a mission."]}]]}],["$","p","Because the problem wasn’t mine alone—almost every Indian man faces the same struggle.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"Because the problem wasn’t mine alone—almost every Indian man faces the same struggle."]}]]}],["$","p","So HAXXED was born.\nNot to sell.\nNot to follow trends.\nBut to create what didn’t exist in India.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"So "]}],["$","span","1",{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"HAXXED"}]," was born.\nNot to sell.\nNot to follow trends.\nBut to create what didn’t exist in India."]}]]}],["$","p","We spent 3+ years in R&D for each product testing, failing, improving.. until we could match international quality, performance, and ingredient safety, at a price that makes sense for Indian consumers.",{"children":["$L11"]}],"$L12"]}]]}],"$L13"]}]
11:["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"We spent 3+ years in R&D for each product testing, failing, improving.. until we could match international quality, performance, and ingredient safety, at a price that makes sense for Indian consumers."]}]
12:["$","p","Indian men deserve world class hair products.\nMade for our hair types, our styles, and our climate.\nThis isn’t just hair styling.\nThis is passion, science, and pride.\nMade in/for India.",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":[false,"Indian men deserve world class hair products.\nMade for our hair types, our styles, and our climate.\nThis isn’t just hair styling.\nThis is passion, science, and pride.\nMade in/for India."]}]]}]
